  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.7 stable: dependency-metadata fix only - no code changes. Versions 1.1.4 and 1.1.6 on nuget.org declared a dependency on `SpawnDev.MultiMedia 0.2.0-rc.1`, but only `SpawnDev.MultiMedia 0.2.0` (stable) was ever published to nuget.org. NuGet falls back to 0.2.0 with NU1603 warning, but consumers with strict warning-as-error policies (some GitHub Actions deploy pipelines) saw build failures. 1.1.7 repacks against the locally-resolvable `SpawnDev.MultiMedia 0.2.0` stable, producing a nuspec with `<dependency id=\"SpawnDev.MultiMedia\" version=\"0.2.0\" />`. No source code differences from 1.1.6.",
